    "body": "The contributor's team wrote Agie-CAM and released it under the MIT license. The open question is whether its documented reference material meets this project's clean-room rules for the native writer.\n\nThe independently sourced machine template is in #2946 and draft PR #2948. Its specifications come from the AGIE handbook. That PR does not include the native writer or its technology settings.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
